subckt sar8_se_timing ACTIVE SAMPLE SEL9 SEL7 SEL6 SEL5 SEL4 COMP_P COMP_N CMP_CLK COMMIT DATA VDD VSS
XPR (COMP_P PR VDD VSS) BUFFD1BWP12T30P140
XNR (COMP_N NR VDD VSS) BUFFD1BWP12T30P140
XNRB (NR NRB VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XDATA (PR NRB DATA VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XRAW (PR NR RAW VDD VSS) XOR2D1BWP12T30P140
XVD (RAW RAW_T VDD VSS) DEL200D1BWP12T30P140
XVALID (RAW RAW_T VALID VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XSN (SAMPLE SN VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
// VALID drives the inner NAND input: CMP_CLK falls first, so the internal node never floats
// when VALID falls (FF-cold terminal-voltage screen).
XW0 (VALID CMP_CLK WD VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XW1 (WD SN WRITE VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XCP (WRITE COMMIT VDD VSS) CKBD1BWP12T30P140
// Tracking clears PHASE, so PHASE_REQUEST and every tap settle high and READY is
// already high when sampling closes: the first trial needs no settling window.
// Each real commit toggles PHASE and launches the opposite transition.
// Two-flop Johnson phase: each register toggles on every second commit, and PHASE = PHA XOR PHB
// changes once per commit without hazards.
XPHA (COMMIT PHB_N SAMPLE VDD VSS PHA) sar8_se_store
XPHBN (PHB PHB_N VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XPHB (COMMIT PHA SAMPLE VDD VSS PHB) sar8_se_store
XPHX (PHA PHB PHASE VDD VSS) XOR2D1BWP12T30P140
XPHR (PHASE PHASE_REQUEST VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XWINDOW (PHASE_REQUEST SEL9 SEL7 SEL6 SEL5 SEL4 VDD VSS DELIVERED) sar8_se_window
XREADY (PHASE DELIVERED READY VDD VSS) XOR2D1BWP12T30P140
// Reset on the committed phase change; only the delayed edge can release reset.
XCLR (READY SN CLR_N VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
// The first compare waits two stages after sampling closes for the bootstrap
// gates to turn off. Reopening the sample clears LIVE through the qualifier.
XSND1 (SN SN_T1 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XSND2 (SN_T1 SN_T2 VDD VSS) DEL250D1BWP12T30P140
XSNQ (SN SN_T2 SN_D VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XLIVE (ACTIVE SN_D LIVE VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XIDLE (RAW CLEARED VDD VSS) INVD1BWP12T30P140
XSET0 (LIVE CLEARED SET0 VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XSET (SET0 READY SET VDD VSS) AN2D1BWP12T30P140
XHIGH (HIGH VDD VSS) TIEHBWP12T30P140
XCLOCK (HIGH SET CLR_N Q VDD VSS) LHCNDQD1BWP12T30P140
XCMP (Q CMP_CLK VDD VSS) CKBD1BWP12T30P140
